; Generated by scripts/generate-flt-point-evaluation.py; checked native terms.
; Evaluation at an actual quadratic
; root kills each witnessed multiple of the defining polynomial.
; Eliminate the actual quotient witness and use proved evaluation
; multiplication, congruence and the supplied root equation.
